==Battleground==
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 50~100 seconds<sup>1,500f~3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 116.67 seconds<sup>3,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.

==Strategies==
Having all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]'s [[True Form]] will make this stage much easier.

Use 3-4 meatshields and bring [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]] like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] and/or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to deal with the One Horn, [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] to deal with the Metal One Horn, and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] for the Cyberhorn.

==Trivia==
*Sweat and Aldehyde's Japanese name, Ase to Arudehido (汗とアルデヒド), still means "Sweat and Aldehyde", but is also a pun on ''asetoarudehido'' (アセトアルデヒド), meaning "[[wikipedia:Acetaldehyde|acetaldehyde]]".

